{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846710/extras/b00d261bba6c5e95e8e0f4b32588237e.avif?t=1753484258\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br>You play as Hiro, a young Japanese man whose life is filled with a boring job. An evening, after a long day at work, you notice a strange light in the park\u2019s trees near your home. You walk to the oldest tree and discover strange symbols on a piece of bark. You understand that this message is addressed to you by the old tree\u2026<br><br>Take your destiny in hand and go on an unexpected adventure to try to understand the symbols which will allow you to communicate with trees.<br><br>Your adventure will take you across Japan to look for answers and discover the incredible secret behind these symbols.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846710/extras/efa11f347de0ce897b8b1cf08c73225f.avif?t=1753484258\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br>KiNoKoe : Tree's voice is an adventure-exploration game with puzzle mechanics.<br>Explore, chat with the locals, solve puzzles, and progress in the story.<br>Your adventure takes place in three beautiful Japanese cities.<br><br>KiNoKoe offers wonderful artistic direction in Voxel. A cubic world, yet surprisingly detailed and full of references, secrets and hidden bonuses. Discover Japan like you've never seen it before and take a seat on a magical journey.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1846710/extras/0ec8f3c18494dc2bc52a2016d96c90af.avif?t=1753484258\" width=590 height=125 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Visit a magnificent representation of Japan made in Voxel<br></li><li>Uncover the incredible secrets of trees and nature through a touching story full of poetry<br></li><li>Explore big cities, chat with locals or travel through the Japanese countryside.<br></li><li>Solve dozens of puzzles and riddles.<br></li><li>Learn language of trees over 60 symbols<br></li><li>Collect dozens of bonuses hidden in the game's vast environments</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Confirmed ecologist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/8ba010d6bd9ae5dd5fc4296daa52e59ed8de7ac7.jpg"},{"name":"Legendary Hero","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/8363016a8b434314884b5bee1779df82a39c4505.jpg"},{"name":"Northern Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/0c320225a1fcbfd000b615d23f1f7e2ea87e032f.jpg"},{"name":"Southern Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/b83f7e6cf282de50cce04b5b0c5538ac5562be97.jpg"},{"name":"Island traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/bae6e131147398c57e6c244d2422e38a2431e4ef.jpg"},{"name":"Snow Traveler","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/60bdd9868e5231efc06ac5c14e847ff5f1679dc0.jpg"},{"name":"Beginner Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/fc6766a0aebb6e89946aa56329075b8764c155a8.jpg"},{"name":"Intermediate Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/50681f10d65871dfa6dc8066a0c7f031d07d05eb.jpg"},{"name":"Expert Explorer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/975ada5eb038c8ded313ac649f9afd1955d9accf.jpg"},{"name":"Linguist expert","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1846710/d4cd0a2c0fd09a4ff85b04efc4a570ed9dd3ca0f.jpg"}],"total":16},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1846710?t=1753484258","ba